        "DefaultText": "Between the Ossuary and the Sunken Lake the roof comes down to a slot in the rock, and the way on is a crawl on your belly, pushing what you carry ahead of you. Very little fits through with you: a light load of tools and food, and no more. If you carry too much, the way on is not offered, from either side, until you carry less."
